EN:
So{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} fossils don't talk, and yet they
have a lot to tell us, right?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}I know!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Deep, huh?{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} {{TAG:0003:0006:}}Science!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
That's where it's at!

IT:
I fossili non parlano,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} eppure hanno
un sacco da dirci!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Lo so!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Profondo, eh?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Ah, la scienza!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
È la bussola della nostra esistenza.

TRANSLATION:
Yani{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} fosiller konuşmuyor ama bize çok şey
anlatıyor, değil mi?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Biliyorum!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Derin laf, ha?{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Bilim!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} İşte mesele bu!
